CM_ SG_ 977 EPAS3P_appliedAngleOffset "This represents the angle delta between the absolute steering angle reference and what EPAS estimates to be straight ahead. The steering angle offset can change up to 5deg at the beginning of each drive cycle.";
CM_ SG_ 977 EPAS3P_calculatedAngleOffset "Reports the calculated steering angle offset learned between the Steering Column Control Module (SCCM) and the Electronic Power Assist Steering (EPAS) steering angle.";
CM_ SG_ 977 EPAS3P_resyncStatus "Electric power steering (primary): resync status";
CM_ SG_ 977 EPAS3P_pullDriftLongTermTrq "The learned, long term pull drift or road crown compensation torque that the rack is applying to the steering wheel.";
CM_ SG_ 977 EPAS3P_pullDriftCompTrq "The current pull drift or road crown compensation torque that the rack is applying to the steering wheel.";
CM_ SG_ 977 EPAS3P_learnedSCCMOffset "Electric power steering (primary): learned SCCM offset";
